   The wider claim the reporter scored at 8.8 is defensible only at class level,
   and the record must say which one it is scoring: the same idiom carried into
   write paths (the sweep fixed roughly 170 sites across ~60 files, including
   UPDATE/DELETE criteria), and the relay's any-method/any-class reachability
