         API surface. CVE <CVE-ID-F2>.
      3. vcalendar.php accepted a password digest as the credential
         (pass-the-hash, CWE-836/CWE-287) and let any authenticated caller read
         any provider's calendar (CWE-639). CVE <CVE-ID-F3>.

